      "content": "BOVINGDON             \tNEWHOUSE ROAD TL 0103 \t\t\t\t\t(North side)                                        10/39                                   \tBarn at -                                      \t\tHonours Farm GV                                      \tII Barn. Early C19 (on 1838 Tithe Map). Timber frame on red brick sill, red brick infill to frame, steep shingled roof. A 3-bays barn facing onto road with boarded double doors in middle bay and low winnowing door to rear. Included for group value. (Roberts(1975)No.35). Listing NGR: TL0125903964"
    }
